 (rc msg log text)←∆Send mailParms;connection
⍝ Sends `mailParms` to the fake SMTP server through a new connection.
⍝ Returns the result of `Connection.Send` plus the message text the server received (still
⍝ dot-stuffed), or '' when it received none. Clears what the server has recorded before.
 ∆SERVER.Clear
 connection←⎕NEW SMTP.Connection(,⊂∆NewParms)
 (rc msg log)←connection.Send mailParms
 text←{0=≢⍵:'' ⋄ ⊃⌽⍵}∆SERVER.Messages
